{
  "id": "last-train",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "rulesVersion": "coc7-subset@1",
  "title": "第零号站台",
  "subtitle": "PLATFORM ZERO",
  "description": "末班车驶向一个不存在的站台。窗玻璃里，你的倒影慢了半拍。",
  "duration": "5–10 分钟",
  "difficulty": "入门",
  "cover": "/art/train.svg",
  "accent": "amber",
  "tags": [
    "都市怪谈",
    "悬疑",
    "多结局"
  ],
  "entry": "train",
  "presets": [
    {
      "id": "reporter",
      "label": "记者",
      "description": "追索被掩埋的真相。擅长侦查与说服。",
      "occupation": "记者",
      "skills": {
        "spotHidden": 65,
        "listen": 45,
        "persuade": 60,
        "stealth": 35
      },
      "hp": 12,
      "sanity": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "doctor",
      "label": "医生",
      "description": "冷静观察每一处异常。擅长聆听与急救。",
      "occupation": "医生",
      "skills": {
        "spotHidden": 45,
        "listen": 65,
        "persuade": 35,
        "stealth": 40,
        "firstAid": 70
      },
      "hp": 13,
      "sanity": 65
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "train",
      "title": "没有终点的列车",
      "text": [
        "23:47。你登上了最后一班列车。窗外的车站没有名字，车厢内只有一位穿灰色外套的乘客。",
        "他指了指你的座位：「上次你也是坐在那里。」"
      ],
      "type": "choice",
      "chapter": "第一章 · 末班车",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "talk",
          "label": "与灰衣乘客交谈",
          "target": "passenger"
        },
        {
          "id": "listen",
          "label": "聆听车厢连接处的声音",
          "target": "listen"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passenger",
      "title": "他保留了你的车票",
      "text": [
        "乘客递来一张泛黄车票。上面的日期是明天，签名却是你的笔迹。「下一站，记得下车。」"
      ],
      "type": "narrative",
      "chapter": "第一章 · 来信",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "next": "station",
      "memory": "灰衣乘客交给你一张日期为明天的旧车票。",
      "enterEffects": [
        {
          "type": "flag",
          "key": "ticket",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "item",
          "key": "ticket",
          "label": "明天的车票"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "listen",
      "title": "车轮之间的低语",
      "text": [
        "铁轨的节奏里夹杂着一个声音，像是在重复某个站名。"
      ],
      "type": "check",
      "chapter": "第一章 · 来信",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "check": {
        "skill": "listen",
        "label": "聆听",
        "difficulty": "regular",
        "success": "heard",
        "failure": "station"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "heard",
      "title": "你的名字是一座车站",
      "text": [
        "你终于听清：车轮重复的是你的名字。你抄下声音之间的停顿，发现一段求救讯号。"
      ],
      "type": "narrative",
      "chapter": "第一章 · 来信",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "next": "station",
      "memory": "车轮重复你的名字；停顿之间藏着求救讯号。",
      "enterEffects": [
        {
          "type": "flag",
          "key": "heard",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "station",
      "title": "站台上没有影子",
      "text": [
        "列车停了下来。站台上站着另一个你。车门正在缓慢开启。"
      ],
      "type": "choice",
      "chapter": "第二章 · 下一站",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "step",
          "label": "拿着车票走下列车",
          "target": "home",
          "condition": {
            "flag": "ticket",
            "equals": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "wait",
          "label": "留在座位上，等待下一站",
          "target": "loop"
        },
        {
          "id": "help",
          "label": "回应求救讯号",
          "target": "rescue",
          "condition": {
            "flag": "heard",
            "equals": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "home",
      "title": "回程",
      "text": [
        "你走过那个没有影子的自己。背后，列车带着他远去。回到家后，你发现口袋里的车票上多了一行字：「已偿还」。"
      ],
      "type": "ending",
      "chapter": "终章",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "ending": "归人"
    },
    {
      "id": "loop",
      "title": "23:47",
      "text": [
        "列车再次驶入无名车站。一位陌生人走进车厢。你指了指他的位置，不由自主地说：「上次你也是坐在那里。」"
      ],
      "type": "ending",
      "chapter": "终章",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "ending": "下一位乘客"
    },
    {
      "id": "rescue",
      "title": "让车轮停下",
      "text": [
        "你按照讯号敲击车窗，列车骤然停住。乘客们从黑暗中醒来。天亮时，你们站在一座早已废弃的车站前，没有人记得自己上车的日期。"
      ],
      "type": "ending",
      "chapter": "终章",
      "background": "/art/train.svg",
      "music": "/media/back-on-the-path.ogg",
      "ending": "破晓"
    }
  ]
}
